{"2408760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Paradell: Mirror Magick ", "steam_appid": 2408760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Your magical farm has a monster problem.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/71588938a4474482ee51203442822ce2.poster.avif?t=1784244863\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/71588938a4474482ee51203442822ce2.webm?t=1784244863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/71588938a4474482ee51203442822ce2.mp4?t=1784244863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious mirror portal has torn open at the edge of your homestead, spilling hordes of mischievous monsters and corrupting dark mana into your world. To save your home, step through the looking glass and enter the <strong>Forgotten Frontier</strong>, a strange mirror realm ruled by <strong>7 celestial gods</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/570e465637e72178c7c6914c1e877ecd.poster.avif?t=1784244863\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/570e465637e72178c7c6914c1e877ecd.webm?t=1784244863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/570e465637e72178c7c6914c1e877ecd.mp4?t=1784244863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive 7 days beyond the mirror in the Forgotten Frontier.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle escalating monster hordes, discover powerful artifacts, and grow stronger with every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > If you fall, return home to tend your farm, sell your harvest for permanent magical upgrades, clear away dark mana, and reclaim more of the land that has been taken from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/63d8a17fbdb5ccfe052b06ed8d3ca391.poster.avif?t=1784244863\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/63d8a17fbdb5ccfe052b06ed8d3ca391.webm?t=1784244863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/63d8a17fbdb5ccfe052b06ed8d3ca391.mp4?t=1784244863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness <strong>elemental magic</strong>, draw <strong>fate-changing tarot cards</strong>, and build wild combinations of spells and powers as you bash your way through the Frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cross through the Mirror.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Defeat the gods.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Take back your home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/9cd75ea52aa7016cc9f9bec2bb858774.poster.avif?t=1784244863\" width=720 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/9cd75ea52aa7016cc9f9bec2bb858774.webm?t=1784244863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/9cd75ea52aa7016cc9f9bec2bb858774.mp4?t=1784244863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you read this far, you are the awesome type of person that makes this all worth it! Join the community to participate in playtests or just hang out! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you sincerely,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Turtle</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Your magical farm has a monster problem.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/71588938a4474482ee51203442822ce2.poster.avif?t=1784244863\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/71588938a4474482ee51203442822ce2.webm?t=1784244863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/71588938a4474482ee51203442822ce2.mp4?t=1784244863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious mirror portal has torn open at the edge of your homestead, spilling hordes of mischievous monsters and corrupting dark mana into your world. To save your home, step through the looking glass and enter the <strong>Forgotten Frontier</strong>, a strange mirror realm ruled by <strong>7 celestial gods</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/570e465637e72178c7c6914c1e877ecd.poster.avif?t=1784244863\" widt