/strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/9cd75ea52aa7016cc9f9bec2bb858774.poster.avif?t=1784244863\" width=720 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/9cd75ea52aa7016cc9f9bec2bb858774.webm?t=1784244863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/extras/9cd75ea52aa7016cc9f9bec2bb858774.mp4?t=1784244863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you read this far, you are the awesome type of person that makes this all worth it! Join the community to participate in playtests or just hang out! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you sincerely,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Turtle</p>", "short_description": "Your magical farm is under siege! Mischievous monsters spill in from a mirror portal to the Forgotten Frontier. Cross through the mirror, survive 7 days, defeat 7 celestial gods, and reclaim your home with elemental magic, fate-changing tarot cards, and good old-fashioned monster bashing!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/4cbb45cd988e8977155f58f06f71e59b38d283ec/header.jpg?t=1784244863", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/2ff0657e72c7136b482964f1794f176389665701/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784244863", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408760/2ff0657e72c7136b482964f1794f176389665701/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784244863", "website": "https://www.theparadell.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bi